```
align-items: stretch;
justify-items: stretch;
```

Which means that if we do not set the legend element's height to `max-content`, then the legend element will take up the entire height of the canvas panel (if it is rendered inside of a canvas panel).

But we need to remove the max-content height rule from the legend element because of a browser bug: [In WebKit, absolutely positioned grid with max-content, min-content or 100% height takes up the entire height of its nearest positioned ancestor](https://codepen.io/gabalafou-the-looper/pen/zxOKBxO).","created_at":"2024-12-11T16:18:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T16:24:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/pull/14191#discussion_r1880500434","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/pulls/14191","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/pulls/comments/1880500434"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/pull/14191#discussion_r1880500434"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/pulls/14191"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/pulls/comments/1880500434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":4,"original_start_line":4,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":5,"original_line":5,"side":"RIGHT","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/pulls/14191","id":2229353570,"node_id":"PR_kwDOADqB3M6E4Txi","html_url":"https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/pull/14191","diff_url":"https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/pull/14191.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/pull/14191.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/issues/14191","number":14191,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Place items in canvas panel grid at start, and remove max-content hei…","user":{"login":"gabalafou","id":317883,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzg4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317883?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabalafou","html_url":"https://github.com/gabalafou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabalafou/followers","following_url":"https://ap